  "rule": "C-ABSENCE.2 asserts SET EQUALITY in both directions between this list and every member name declared across the eight document schemas. It is an ALLOWLIST, never a denylist: a denylist of nine English words is defeated by patron_ref, booker or contact_handle, and it collides with venue.name on the first run. The mechanism is that adding a personal-data field becomes an act a person must perform deliberately, in public, in the diff.",
